# Ruleset: GitHub
#
# Expects a proxy policy, the same one as general traffic. The list keeps every GitHub host on that one policy: the release asset and Copilot blob hosts sit on S3 and Azure, inside the suffixes of Platforms/Amazon.list and Platforms/Microsoft.list, whose groups are chosen independently, and ghcr.io and formulae.brew.sh fail on the direct path. Must precede those sets.
#
# Known risk on Hong Kong exits, measured 2026-08-12: both providers' Hong Kong exits intermittently dropped the TLS handshake to GitHub's Asia frontend (20.205.243.166), 12.5% to 17.5% of fresh connections, while Japan and Singapore were clean at 0 of 30. The client hello goes out and nothing returns for about 7 s; a browser retry succeeds. A group's availability probe does not catch a failure rate this low, so if it returns, the remedy is an exit outside Hong Kong for this list.
#
# ghcr.io lives here rather than in Registries/Registries.list: it is blocked on the direct path, and it is GitHub, so it should share their exit.
#
# formulae.brew.sh is a GitHub Pages custom domain (CNAME homebrew.github.io) that stalls on the direct path, which is why it cannot stay with brew.sh and docs.brew.sh or with Registries/Registries.list. Measured 2026-08-16: three fresh fetches of the 34MB formula.jws.json index each timed out at 90s after 5.8 to 8.8MB (64 to 98kB/s); the same file through Japan finished in 1.28 to 1.39s (24 to 27MB/s). The 21MB cask.jws.json index timed out the same way DIRECT and finished in 2.14s through Japan. brew.sh and docs.brew.sh reach a proxy through FINAL, so they stay out of this list.
#
# github.io is deliberately absent. GitHub Pages is served from different infrastructure; the Pages custom domain above is listed on its own evidence.

DOMAIN-SUFFIX,github.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,githubassets.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,githubusercontent.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,githubapp.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,githubnext.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ghcr.io
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,formulae.brew.sh
DOMAIN,github-cloud.s3.amazonaws.com
DOMAIN-WILDCARD,github-production-*.s3.amazonaws.com
DOMAIN,copilotprodattachments.blob.core.windows.net
DOMAIN-WILDCARD,productionresultssa*.blob.core.windows.net
